{"id":"00b872b34c5e977d","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-logic-algebra.md","title":"Logic Algebra","display":"df-logic-algebra — Logic Algebra","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-logic-algebra","aliases":["93-df-logic-algebra"],"display":"df-logic-algebra — Logic Algebra","depends_on":["[[93-df-similarity-type]]","[[93-df-algebra]]","[[93-df-language]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-logic-algebra"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-logic-algebra</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-logic-algebra — Logic Algebra"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" href=\"?note=ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" title=\"93-df-similarity-type\">93-df-similarity-type</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a33dcee0f62c9026\" href=\"?note=a33dcee0f62c9026\" title=\"93-df-language\">93-df-language</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> is a language candidate and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{93}(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\tau_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\)</span> is its sourced type projection.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lang}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Lang}_{93}\\)</span> is the language predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a33dcee0f62c9026\" href=\"?note=a33dcee0f62c9026\" title=\"93-df-language\">93-df-language</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\)</span> is a <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{93}(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\tau_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\)</span>-algebra candidate.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\\)</span> is the algebra predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LogicAlg}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{LogicAlg}_{93}\\)</span> (logic-algebra predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}logic\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LogicAlg}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Lang}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\land\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau_{93}(\\mathcal L)}(\\mathfrak A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}logic\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LogicAlg}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Lang}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\land\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau_{93}(\\mathcal L)}(\\mathfrak A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The connective similarity type is recovered by the sourced projection <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{93}(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\tau_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\)</span> rather than a prose-only abbreviation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-similarity-type","status":"resolved","id":"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-similarity-type]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"6730349967b8ffce","anch